{"id":"c61ecbdec24f26e8","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-proof-tree.md","title":"GL Proof Tree","display":"df-gl-proof-tree — GL Proof Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-proof-tree","aliases":["89-df-gl-proof-tree"],"display":"df-gl-proof-tree — GL Proof Tree","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]","[[89-df-gl-rule]]","[[89-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-proof-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-proof-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-proof-tree — GL Proof Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})\">\\(\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}=(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal{A}_{G\\!L},\n\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L})\\)</span> is the proof system from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" href=\"?note=1cc1d3718e1d5f3b\" title=\"89-df-gl-proof-system\">89-df-gl-proof-system</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land r\\in N\n\\land\\ell:N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\land\\chi:N\\to\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}N^k\n\\land\\ell(r)=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists n\\in N\\;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\\;\n\\chi(n)(i)=r\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in N\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!\\langle n,i\\rangle\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in N\\land i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\n\\land\\chi(n)(i)=m\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in N\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p:k+1\\to N\\;\n\\Bigl(p(0)=r\\land p(k)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}{}\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\exists j\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(p(i)))\\;\np(i+1)=\\chi(p(i))(j)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))=0\\to\\ell(n)\\in\\mathcal A_{G\\!L})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}\\land\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\\ne0\\to\n(\\ell\\circ\\chi(n),\\ell(n))\\in\\mathcal R_{G\\!L})\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PT}_{G\\!L}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{T=(N,r,\\chi,\\ell)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land r\\in N\n\\land\\ell:N\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\land\\chi:N\\to\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}N^k\n\\land\\ell(r)=A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists n\\in N\\;\\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\\;\n\\chi(n)(i)=r\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in N\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!\\langle n,i\\rangle\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in N\\land i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\n\\land\\chi(n)(i)=m\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in N\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists p:k+1\\to N\\;\n\\Bigl(p(0)=r\\land p(k)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}{}\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;\\exists j\\in\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(p(i)))\\;\np(i+1)=\\chi(p(i))(j)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))=0\\to\\ell(n)\\in\\mathcal A_{G\\!L})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}{}\\land\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\chi(n))\\ne0\\to\n(\\ell\\circ\\chi(n),\\ell(n))\\in\\mathcal R_{G\\!L})\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(n)\">\\(\\chi(n)\\)</span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的<strong>有序有限子节点序列</strong>，所以\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\chi(n)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\chi(n)\\)</span> 与规则关系的有限前提序列签名一致。</li>\n<li>根不作为任何节点的子节点；每个非根节点恰有一个父节点；路径条件保证\n所有节点都从根可达。有限性由此排除环。</li>\n<li>GL证明树的根标签是结论</li>\n<li>GL证明树用于分析 GL 证明</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-rule","status":"resolved","id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1cc1d3718e1d5f3b","anchor":"ref-4","target